{"4914400": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "HellDay", "steam_appid": 4914400, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Survive the crash. Repair the boat. Escape the island.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After a helicopter crash leaves you stranded on a remote island, survival becomes your only objective. Search abandoned locations, gather resources, hunt for food, build a shelter, and repair an old boat before the horrors lurking in the wilderness find you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The island is filled with dangerous creatures, mysterious events, and hidden secrets. Every journey requires careful planning, resource management, and exploration as you fight to stay alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you choose to explore forests, abandoned structures, or remote shorelines, danger is never far away.<br><br>Features</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Explore a large open-world island.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Experience immersive first-person survival horror.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Fight terrifying enemies using multiple weapons.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build and upgrade your own base.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather resources, craft equipment, and survive.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hunt wildlife for food and supplies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Search for parts and repair a boat to escape.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Encounter dynamic horror events and unpredictable dangers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage your inventory and essential survival resources.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover hidden locations, secrets, and environmental storytelling.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Early Access</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >HellDay is actively being developed. Throughout Early Access we will continue expanding the world, improving AI, adding new enemies, expanding crafting and base building, introducing additional survival mechanics, optimizing performance, and incorporating community feedback to shape the game's future.</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Survive the crash. Repair the boat. Escape the island.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After a helicopter crash leaves you stranded on a remote island, survival becomes your only objective. Search abandoned locations, gather resources, hunt for food, build a shelter, and repair an old boat before the horrors lurking in the wilderness find you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The island is filled with dangerous creatures, mysterious events, and hidden secrets. Every journey requires careful planning, resource management, and exploration as you fight to stay alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you choose to explore forests, abandoned structures, or remote shorelines, danger is never far away.<br><br>Features</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Explore a large open-world island.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Experience immersive first-person survival horror.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Fight terrifying enemies using multiple weapons.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build and upgrade your own base.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather resources, craft equipment, and survive.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hunt wildlife for food and supplies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Search for parts and repair a boat to escape.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Encounter dynamic horror events and unpredictable dangers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage your inventory and essential survival resources.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover hidden locations, secrets, and environmental storytelling.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Early Access</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >HellDay is actively being developed. Throughout Early Access we will continue expanding the world, improving AI, adding new enemies, expanding crafting and base building, introducing additional survival mechanics, optimizing performance, and incorporating community feedback to shape the game's future.</p>", "short_description": "An open-world survival horror game where you explore a mysterious island, build a base, hunt, craft, fight terrifying creatures, and repair a boat to escape.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4914400/8451d5c2ef457ef643dcec71bf68b011524f1909/header.jpg?t=1788242540", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4914400/dd3852e1241e9d78f514819ac097f57487165e95/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1788242540", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4914400/dd3852e1241e9d78f514819ac097f57487165e95/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1788242540", "website": "https://redtrigames.com/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit (20H2 or newer)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-4460 (3.2 GHz) / AMD FX-6300<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 960 2GB / AMD Radeon R9 280 (or equivalent)<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 15 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> DirectX compatible<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> 64-bit processor and operating system required</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum